EPIC-260716-3fyjn0_manual-validation-and-approvals/README.md:4:Human-in-the-loop work extracted from M0-M5 so every other epic is agent-autonomous end-to-end. Contains (macOS-first under ADR-013/ADR-024: the physical-iPhone matrices and every App Review item are deferred, recorded as named gaps, and re-arm unchanged): physical iPhone/Mac validation matrices, macOS system-extension GUI approvals, Apple Developer portal and account administration, App Review submission and external waits, product and legal decisions, go/no-go gate dispositions, and credential ceremonies. Stories are grouped per milestone: each story is the human checkpoint that runs after the corresponding autonomous epic completes its implementation scope. Ordering is enforced by the existing task-level dependency links, which survive the re-parenting; this epic intentionally has no epic-level summary dependencies (see M3 logbook precedent).
